*BEGIN ValleyEntrance
*export 0 27

; Locn: West Kingsdale
; Cave: KMC
*title "Valley Entrance"
*date 2012.08.04

*team DistoX Tony Cook
*team Notes Footleg
*instrument WSCC DistoX1, Footleg's Dell Axim x51v PDA, PocketTopo V1.36
; Calibration: DistoX was calibration checked at start of trip. Back sights were taken for visual checking of all legs 
; on PDA sketch (represented by splays in this data). Magnetic steel toe caps in wellies resulted in some problems 
; with matching back shots to forward shots when feet too close to Disto. Legs were re-measured when this occurred. 
; See triangulation legs at stations 16-21 testing for problems. The DistoX was recalibrated at this point due to 
; concerns with clino calibration at this point where legs with significant slope were first measured on this trip.

*calibrate declination +2.57	;taken from NOAA website
;*calibrate declination +2.24 

*entrance 0
*fix 0 69908.00 77410.00 279.00 ;GPS Footleg  369908.00 477410.00 279.00

